sprite_index = spr_creator
text = [
	"Oh, look, you found me...",
	"Good job.",
	". . .",
	"What, you thought I'd share some #big secret?",
	"Well, tough luck, kid.&I'm hard-pressed to finish #this world as it is.",
	"I mean, you can always @ffff00return to #Soos's walk test @ffffffand decrypt the #sign in the middle...",
	"But of course, you already knew #that, right?&Surely you must have...",
	"Because if not, that's kind of #embarrassing, so...&Don't tell me.",
	"Now, get out of here.&I have work to do.",
	"Yes, I must stand here and look #ominous for anyone else who comes."
